cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the paper below."
title: "Which margin absorbs the shock? Replication package"
abstract: >-
  Replication code and derived data for a study of how the external adjustment
  margin — import compression, reserve drawdown, or exchange rate depreciation —
  conditions the inflationary consequences of commodity terms-of-trade shocks in
  49 resource-rich economies, 1990-2026.
